# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Price data are NOT committed: they belong to their providers (Yahoo Finance,
# iShares, the Korea Exchange, FRED) and redistribution may be restricted.
# `python run_all.py` downloads whatever is missing.
# What IS committed:
#   data/raw/manifest.json          source and download date of every file
#   data/reference/members_*.csv    members and weights of each index on the day of the study
data/raw/*
!data/raw/manifest.json
